{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"trinket_sunheart","model_identifier":"trinket_sunheart","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## trinket_sunheart\n\nTrinket, sunheart.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (2 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.8..4.8, y -11.0..0.0, z -0.9..0.5 (size 9.5 x 11.0 x 1.4 u = 27 x 31 x 4 cm).\nSunheart: a sunburst (9.5 u across) of eight rays (two of them rotated cubes for the diagonals) round a stepped disc with a red ruby core, on a fine chain. Embedded in gold as described; the other metals are trade variants. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: gold. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_sunheart_copper.png`, `trinket_sunheart_tin.png`, `trinket_sunheart_bronze.png`, `trinket_sunheart_iron.png`, `trinket_sunheart_steel.png`, `trinket_sunheart_silver.png`, `trinket_sunheart_gold.png`\n"},"description":"## trinket_sunheart\n\nTrinket, sunheart.\n\n- Cubes: 8 (2 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.8..4.8, y -11.0..0.0, z -0.9..0.5 (size 9.5 x 11.0 x 1.4 u = 27 x 31 x 4 cm).\nSunheart: a sunburst (9.5 u across) of eight rays (two of them rotated cubes for the diagonals) round a stepped disc with a red ruby core, on a fine chain. Embedded in gold as described; the other metals are trade variants. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: gold. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_sunheart_copper.png`, `trinket_sunheart_tin.png`, `trinket_sunheart_bronze.png`, `trinket_sunheart_iron.png`, `trinket_sunheart_steel.png`, `trinket_sunheart_silver.png`, `trinket_sunheart_gold.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"chain","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.1,-1.5,-0.1],"to":[0.1,0.0,0.1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,10,24.2,11.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[25,10,25.2,11.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[26,10,26.2,11.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[27,10,27.2,11.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[11,13,11.2,13.2],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[12,13,12.2,13.2],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"cd0e45d3-3e04-597f-9ce7-d9c3a8f0388f"},{"name":"ray_v","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.6,-11.0,-0.3],"to":[0.6,-1.5,0.3],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,1.2,9.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4,0,4.6,9.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[2,0,3.2,9.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[5,0,5.6,9.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[3,13,4.2,13.6],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[5,13,6.2,13.6],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ea1689ef-4926-5a4e-bcbe-f3c60cd62c46"},{"name":"ray_h","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.75,-6.85,-0.3],"to":[4.75,-5.65,0.3],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,10,9.5,11.2],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[28,10,28.6,11.2],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[10,10,19.5,11.2],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[29,10,29.6,11.2],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,12,9.5,12.6],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[10,12,19.5,12.6],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"22e09a3b-8592-5d3e-a9fb-5925a4e0136c"},{"name":"ray_d1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"rend